# taught_question_qualifier.p0t — IL QUALIFICATORE DELLA DOMANDA SI INSEGNA
# PARLANDO (gen515, 18 settembre 2026; piano lettura-della-prosa.md).
#
# La cornice delle risposte rispondeva sulla cue e ignorava il resto della
# domanda («estimated at IN 2020» → la cifra del 1997). Quali parole restringono
# il valore chiesto e' conoscenza (question_qualifier/2, grammar.p0), e quindi
# una parola nuova e' una lezione: nessun predicato, nessuna arita'. Le entita'
# qui sono inventate: il test prova la MECCANICA (una lezione vale dal turno
# dopo e si ritratta), non una conoscenza del mondo.

[test a qualifier opener taught by talking restricts the value from the next turn]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset
!timeout 60
> The value of the fleet was estimated at 30 billion (a 1997 estimate) to 2.7 trillion (a 2020 estimate).
> what was the value of the fleet estimated at towards 2020?
<! I don't know
<~ 30 billion
> a question that says "towards" asks about a time
<~ From now on «towards»
> what was the value of the fleet estimated at towards 2020?
<~ I don't know about «towards 2020»
> forget that a question that says "towards" asks about a time
<~ I no longer read «towards»
> what was the value of the fleet estimated at towards 2020?
<! I don't know
<~ 30 billion
